Package: litman
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jingdong Zhang
Depends: libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1, libegl1, libdbus-1-3, xdg-utils
Description: Local-first literature manager
 LitMan scans existing PDF directories, stores editable metadata in a
 portable SQLite database, and provides native GUI and CLI interfaces.
